n initialized TemplateArgument instance.\n228:      */\n229:     public Object createTemplateArgument();\n230: \n231:     /**\n232:      * Create an empty but initialized instance of a UML TemplateParameter.\n233:      *\n234:      * @return an initialized UML TemplateParameter instance.\n235:      */\n236:     Object createTemplateParameter();\n237: \n238:     /**\n239:      * Create an empty but initialized instance of a UML Usage.\n240:      *\n241:      * @return an initialized UML Usage instance.\n242:      */\n243:     Object createUsage();\n244: \n245:     /**\n246:      * Builds a binary associationrole on basis of two classifierroles,\n247:      * navigation and aggregation.\n248:      *\n249:      * @param fromClassifier   the first given classifier\n250:      * @param aggregationKind1 the first aggregationkind\n251:      * @param toClassifier     the second given classifier\n252:      * @param aggregationKind2 the second aggregationkind\n253:      * @param unidirectional true if unidirectional\n254:      * @return the newly build binary associationrole\n255:      */\n256:     Object buildAssociation(Object fromClassifier, Object aggregationKind1,\n257:             Object toClassifier, Object aggregationKind2,\n258:             Boolean unidirectional);\n259: \n260:     /**\n261:      * Builds a binary associations between two classifiers with\n262:      * default values for the association ends and the association\n263:      * itself.<p>\n264:      *\n265:      * @param classifier1 The first classifier to connect\n266:      * @param classifier2 The second classifier to connect\n267:      * @return MAssociation\n268:      */\n269:     Object buildAssociation(Object classifier1, Object classifier2);\n270: \n271:     /**\n272:      * Builds a binary association with a direction, aggregation\n273:      * and a given name.\n274:      *\n275:      * @param c1 The first classifier to connect to\n276:      * @param nav1 The navigability of the Associaton end\n277: