Change the current Locale.\n88:      *\n89:      * @param locale the new Locale\n90:      */\n91:     public static void setLocale(Locale locale) {\n92:         org.workingfrog.i18n.util.Translator.setLocale(locale);\n93:     }\n94: \n95:     /**   \n96:      * Loads image bindings from a File.\n97:      *\n98:      * @param file the properties file\n99:      * @return the properties in file\n100:      */\n101:     private static Properties loadImageBindings(String file) {\n102: \n103:         InputStream inputStream = null;\n104:         Properties properties = new Properties();\n105: \n106:         try {\n107:             inputStream = Translator.class.getResourceAsStream(propertiesFile);\n108:             properties.load(inputStream);\n109:             inputStream.close();\n110:         } catch (IOException ex) {\n111:             LOG.fatal(\"Unable to load properties from file: \" + file, ex);\n112:             System.exit(1);\n113:         }\n114: \n115:         return properties;\n116:     }\n117: \n118:     /**   \n119:      * Provide a \"gef compliant\" image file name.\n120:      *\n121:      * @param name the new i18n key\n122:      * @return the old i18n key\n123:      */\n124:     public static String getImageBinding(String name) {\n125: \n126:         String binding = null;\n127: \n128:         if (images == null) {\n129:             images = loadImageBindings(propertiesFile);\n130:         }\n131: \n132:         binding = images.getProperty(name);\n133: \n134:         if (binding == null) {\n135:             return name;\n136:         } else {\n137:             return binding;\n138:         }\n139:     }\n140: \n141:     /** \n142:      * Helper for localization to eliminate the need to import\n143:      * the gef util library.<p>\n144:      *\n145:      * This is only used when retrieving the strings localized in GEF.\n146:      *\n147:      * @deprecated by Linus Tolke as of 0.17.2.\n148:      *             Use {@link #localize(String key)}.\n149:   