elFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n86:     }\n87: \n88:     /**\n89:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateAttribute(\n90:      *          java.lang.Object, boolean)\n91:      */\n92:     public String generateAttribute(Object handle, boolean documented) {\n93: \treturn \"Attribute(\" + ModelFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n94:     }\n95: \n96:     /**\n97:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateParameter(java.lang.Object)\n98:      */\n99:     public String generateParameter(Object handle) {\n100: \treturn \"Parameter(\" + ModelFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n101:     }\n102: \n103:     /**\n104:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generatePackage(java.lang.Object)\n105:      */\n106:     public String generatePackage(Object handle) {\n107: \treturn \"Package(\" + ModelFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n108:     }\n109: \n110:     /**\n111:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateClassifier(java.lang.Object)\n112:      */\n113:     public String generateClassifier(Object handle) {\n114: \treturn \"Classifier(\" + ModelFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n115:     }\n116: \n117:     /**\n118:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateTaggedValue(java.lang.Object)\n119:      */\n120:     public String generateTaggedValue(Object handle) {\n121: \treturn \"TaggedValue(\" + ModelFacade.getTag(handle) + \")\";\n122:     }\n123: \n124:     /**\n125:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateAssociation(java.lang.Object)\n126:      */\n127:     public String generateAssociation(Object handle) {\n128: \treturn \"Association(\" + ModelFacade.getName(handle) + \")\";\n129:     }\n130: \n131:     /**\n132:      * @see org.argouml.application.api.NotationProvider2#generateAssociationEnd(java.lang.Object)\n133:      */\n134:     public String generateAssociationEnd(Object handle) {\n135: \treturn \"AssociationEnd(\" + ModelFacade.getNa