                    "kwargs": {
                        "content": "Has the original ask been met?  \nNo. The code still converts the File to a URL and calls a `doLoad(URL, \u2026)` method, and it still imports and handles `MalformedURLException`. The intent was to remove all URL\u2010based APIs in favor of File parameters.\n\nWhat needs to change:  \n- In AbstractFilePersister.doLoad(File, \u2026) (lines 256\u2013263):  \n  - Remove the `try { return doLoad(file.toURL(), \u2026); } catch (MalformedURLException e) { \u2026 }` block.  \n  - Instead, directly invoke a new or existing `doLoad(File file, JProgressBar, JTextComponent)` abstract method on subclasses.  \n  - Remove the `import java.net.MalformedURLException;` at line 32.  \n\nThe task is INCOMPLETE.",
